<title>USA: Texaco, Shell, Marathon plan U.S. Gulf pipeline.</title>
<headline>Texaco, Shell, Marathon plan U.S. Gulf pipeline.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>A network of crude oil pipelines is being planned by affiliates of Shell Oil Co, Texaco Trading and Transportation Inc, and Marathon Oil Co to transport production from deep water projects in the eastern Gulf of Mexico.</p>
<p>The pipeline will have a capacity of 300,000 barrels per day the companies said in a statement Wednesday.</p>
</text>
